@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BorderColor #555555
hide empty description
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef3fb
skinparam StateBorderColor #4a6fa5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffbe6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #b28704
left to right direction
[*] --> OPEN : retries exhausted, loop limit, escalate, requestApproval, ABANDON, quiesce timeout
OPEN --> OPEN : fallback due, fallback run planned once
OPEN --> OPEN : APPROVAL - APPROVE vote below quorum
OPEN --> DECIDED : CHOICE - business user picks an option
OPEN --> DECIDED : APPROVAL - quorum of distinct APPROVE votes or one REJECT
DECIDED --> [*]
note right of OPEN
  Never expires, D38.
  Only the subject waits,
  everything else continues.
end note
@enduml
